Added branch-prediction hints so the common valid-field path stays straight-line and the rare invalid returns are placed out of line. This preserves all bounds/null behavior while reducing branch-layout overhead.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetNum(void) const
{
    if (__builtin_expect(profile == NULL, 0))
        return FIT_FIELD_NUM_INVALID;
    if (__builtin_expect(profileIndex >= profile->numFields, 0))
        return FIT_FIELD_NUM_INVALID;
    return profile->fields[profileIndex].num;
}
```